From 468b91e3963b560d8be6b20b41377d541f38d911 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dev <dev@local>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 11:21:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(serve): NVIDIA models (BNR + Studio Voice) with API key
 fallback + daily quota

- serve/providers/nvidia_maxine.py: gRPC NVCF connector (transactional) for
  Background Noise Removal and Studio Voice, faithful to NVIDIA-Maxine/nim-clients.
- serve/keys.py: key resolution (user key = unlimited, shared key = quota).
- serve/quota.py: SQLite daily quota per IP.
- serve/server.py: /models lists NVIDIA models; /denoise routes + enforces key/quota;
  new /quota endpoint; X-API-Key header; optional BNR intensity.
- serve/test_client.html: optional NVIDIA key field + remaining-quota hint.
- .env.example / requirements-serve.txt / serve/NVIDIA.md: config, deps, docs.
- serve/tests: integration test (10 cases, no torch/network).
